  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Radius of orbit&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>529</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Where, n = principal quantum number of orbit</p><p>Z = Atomic number</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msup><mi>Li</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>529</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msup><mi>Be</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></msub></mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>529</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Divide equation (1) by equation (2)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msup><mi>Li</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></msub></mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</